# Public OAuth client ID from https://developer.audiotool.com/applications.
# Never put an Audiotool client secret here.
#
# The application registration must satisfy all three, or the KYX export panel
# hangs on a popup that can never return (the SDK has no timeout of its own; the
# panel falls back to one after 180 s and then says which of these is wrong):
#   1. scope `project:write` is granted to the application,
#   2. a Redirect URI registered whose origin is exactly the one KYX is served
#      from — `http://127.0.0.1:5173` for local dev, `https://qvesterstudio.com`
#      in production. `targetOrigin` is sent to the accounts service and is
#      validated against these registered origins,
#   3. the client ID below is the one of that same application.
VITE_AUDIOTOOL_NEXUS_CLIENT_ID=

# Where the NEXUS SDK fetches its validator at runtime. The SDK reads the WASM
# from disk automatically under Node, but in a browser it fetches it, so this
# must point at a real path or every createOfflineDocument() call 404s.
# Vendor both files into public/audiotool-nexus/ (see
# scripts/vendor-audiotool-wasm.mjs).
VITE_WASM_ASSETS_PREFIX=/audiotool-nexus/
